# Unknown type names fall through to the conservative `_ => true` wildcard arm.
# "Boolean" was previously a named arm; it was removed, leaving it to fall through.
# On pass, builtin-check-type returns the value unchanged (not Int(1)).
# Mutation guard: adding `"Boolean" => false` would raise instead of returning 42.
[result: [builtin-check-type "Boolean" 42]]
=== out
Dict({"result": Int(42)})
